sequenceDiagram
    actor Client
    participant Router as API Router (/documents)
    participant Validator as Pydantic
    participant Svc as Document Service
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Client->>Router: POST /documents (UploadFile)
    Router->>Validator: Validate Request
    Validator-->>Router: Validated
    Router->>Svc: create(file)
    
    Svc->>Svc: save_upload() -> disk
    Svc->>Svc: extract_text()
    Svc->>Svc: chunk_text()
    Svc->>Svc: get_embeddings_batch()
    
    Svc->>DB: session.add(Document)
    Svc->>DB: session.flush()
    Svc->>DB: session.add_all(Chunks)
    Svc->>DB: session.commit()
    
    DB-->>Svc: Persisted Entities
    Svc-->>Router: Document Model
    Router-->>Client: 200 OK (DocumentResponse JSON)
